



>> CoffeeGrounds := څیز نوی.
CoffeeGrounds کله: ⌝'extract'⌜ وکړه: ⎬ <- ⌝'coffee'⌜. ⎨.

>> CoffeeMachine := څیز نوی.
CoffeeMachine کله: ⌝'init'⌜ وکړه: ⎬
	خپل coffeegrounds := CoffeeGrounds نوی.
⎨.
CoffeeMachine کله: ⌝'نوی'⌜ وکړه: ⎬ <- CoffeeMachine `new init.
⎨.

CoffeeMachine کله: ⌝'makeTea'⌜ وکړه: ⎬ <- ﴿خپل tealeaves extract﴾. ⎨.
CoffeeMachine کله: ⌝'makeCoffee'⌜ وکړه: ⎬ <- ﴿خپل coffeegrounds extract﴾. ⎨.

>> coffeeDream := CoffeeMachine نوی.

وتنه ولیکه:
	coffeeDream 
	makeCoffee.

وتنه ولیکه:
	coffeeDream 
	makeTea.
